"chat on [IRC](https://webchat.freenode.net/?channels=#promises)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/bluebird_README.md:10
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/bluebird_README.md:12
msgid ""
"Bluebird is a fully featured promise library with focus on innovative "
"features and performance"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/bluebird_README.md:14
msgid ""
"See the [**bluebird website**](http://bluebirdjs.com/docs/getting-"
"started.html) for further documentation, references and instructions. See"
" the [**API reference**](http://bluebirdjs.com/docs/api-reference.html) "
"here."
msgstr ""

