msgid ""
"For bluebird 2.x documentation and files, see the [2.x "
"tree](https://github.com/petkaantonov/bluebird/tree/2.x)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/bluebird_README.md:18
msgid "Questions and issues"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/bluebird_README.md:20
msgid ""
"The [github issue "
"tracker](https://github.com/petkaantonov/bluebird/issues) is **_only_** "
"for bug reports and feature requests. Anything else, such as questions "
"for help in using the library, should be posted in "
"[StackOverflow](http://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/bluebird) under"
" tags `promise` and `bluebird`."
msgstr ""

